# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) for local dev, and set the same var in the
# Cloudflare Pages project env for production. Never commit a real key.

# Free CARTO Basemaps API key — authenticates the "Standard" raster tiles so they
# render without the "API KEY REQUIRED" watermark (CARTO now requires a key for
# raster basemaps). Get one in a minute, no account needed:
#   https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey  (give your email + the site's domain)
# It's a public, domain-restricted basemap key (exposed in client tile requests
# by nature) — kept out of the repo, not a private secret. If unset, the Standard
# basemap falls back to keyless CyclOSM tiles and logs a warning.
VITE_CARTO_BASEMAP_KEY=
